            <ArticleTitle>Basic mechanisms of pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>63-6, 69-70, 75-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It has been well established that pain reflects complex, linked neuroendocrine responses that go far beyond a sensory alarm system. Accordingly, there may be significant medical consequences of inadequate recognition or treatment of pain.</AbstractText>
